{"3972530": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Street Life Simulator", "steam_appid": 3972530, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>You’ve lost everything to debt.<br>Now, you’re on the streets — survive, or become their prey.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your job is gone, your possessions seized.<br>With nothing left, you must start from scratch — beg for coins, collect trash, sell what you find, and fight to pay off your crushing debt.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >By day, interact with strangers on the streets and in traffic —<br>some will help, some will ignore you, and some will lash out.<br>By night, return to your shabby shelter — rest, store your items, and slowly turn your broken shack into a safe, livable home.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every choice matters.<br>Can you manage your money wisely, protect yourself from thieves, and keep your spirit alive?<br>Or will the streets take everything from you once again?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🔹 <strong>Key Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Survive the Streets:</strong> Beg, scavenge, sell, and fight to stay alive.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Upgrade Your Shelter:</strong> Start with a broken shack and transform it into a safe home.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dynamic NPC Reactions:</strong> Experience unique responses based on mood and situation.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Risk vs. Comfort:</strong> Balance hunger, energy, hygiene, and morale while facing constant danger.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Realistic Street Life:</strong> A raw, emotional survival experience about loss, resilience, and hope.</p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>You’ve lost everything to debt.<br>Now, you’re on the streets — survive, or become their prey.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your job 